## 🧠 12. Quick Memory Tricks

- `CREATE TABLE` → Create the table 🏗️
- `INSERT INTO` → Add rows ➕
- `SELECT *` → Display all columns 👀
- `PRIMARY KEY` → Unique identity 🔑
- `INT` → Whole numbers 🔢
- `VARCHAR` → Text 🔤

